#. …どこに行くの？
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Where are you going?"
msgstr ""

#. え？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 今の彼は…あまり連れ回さない方が
#. いいんじゃないかしら…
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It's probably best if you don't drag him around with\n"
"you too much, given his current condition."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言って、霧切さんは
#. ボクの後ろの石丸クンを見やった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko looked at Taka, standing behind me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…わかってるよ…
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, I know that..."
msgstr ""

#. その…お腹が空いたらしくて…
#. だから一緒に食堂か倉庫に行こうかと思って…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But I was getting kinda hungry. I thought we could\n"
"head to the dining hall or warehouse or something..."
msgstr ""

#. そう…ならいいけど…
msgctxt "0007 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Well then, I guess that's okay."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんとなく、疑ってるように見えたのは…
#. 気のせい…だよな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I thought I saw a brief flicker of doubt. But maybe it\n"
"was just my imagination...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 腐川さ…じゃない…？
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is that...Toko?"
msgstr ""

#. およよ～ん？　二人で何してんの？
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Hmmm? What are you two up to?"
msgstr ""

#. あはぁぁぁぁん！
#. もしかしてぇ、もしかしてぇ、もしかするぅ！？
msgctxt "0011 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Ahhhhh~! Don't tell me you're gonna—you're gonna—!?"
msgstr ""

#. 心の兄弟を失った隙につけいる寝取り展開…
#. 萌えねー事もねーぜ…
msgctxt "0012 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Having lost his new \"brother,\" Taka is ripe for the\n"
"taking. So Makoto swoops in to steal him away...!"
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラゲラゲラゲラッ！
msgctxt "0013 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Am I on fire...? Kyeeehahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>うっかりジェノサイダーに話しかけた事を
#. 酷く後悔した…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I severely regretted talking to Genocide Jack, even if\n"
"by accident.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …って、そんな事はどーでもいい！
#. 白夜様、見なかったか！
msgctxt "0015 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"But that doesn't matter right now! Have you seen\n"
"Byakuya!?"
msgstr ""

#. え？　見てないけど…
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? N-No, I haven't..."
msgstr ""

#. あぁん、もうッ！
#. 愛を試されてるわぁ！
msgctxt "0017 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Ahh, good heavens! My love is being pushed to the\n"
"limit!"
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラゲラゲラゲラッ！！
msgctxt "0018 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Kyeehahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>行っちゃった…十神クンも大変だな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I almost feel bad for him...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>石丸クンにアルターエゴを見せるんだった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wanted to show Taka Alter Ego...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今は、脱衣所に向かおう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I should head to the dressing room as soon as\n"
